[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……！\u3000無事に到着しましたね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew...! We made it safely!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここが学問の島、カロストンか。\n街の中央に図書館があるという話だったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is Karlston, the island of learning. I heard there's a library in the center of town."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。早速向かいましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. Let's head there right away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ、ここがカロストンかぁ。\n真面目そうな人たちがたくさんいる……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-so this is Karlston... There are so many serious-looking people here..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "学問の島だからかしら。厳かな雰囲気ね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I suppose that's because it's the island of learning. The atmosphere is so solemn."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "観光なんて浮ついた目的はお断り、なんて言われたら\nどうしよう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What if they tell us that sightseeing is frivolous and unwelcome?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこは確かに心配なところ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That is indeed a legitimate concern."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップちゃん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確かここの入国審査では、得意とする隠し芸を\n披露するというのがあったはず……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I believe their immigration process requires visitors to demonstrate a special talent or skill..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "か、隠し芸！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A s-special talent?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでも、入国希望者が何を極めようとしているか、\n入国に相応しいかを見極めるためだとか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Apparently, it's to determine what field the applicant is trying to master and whether they're worthy of entry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は？\u3000そんな馬鹿げた入国審査があるわけないでしょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What? There's no way such a ridiculous immigration process exists."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミミちゃん、そんなことないかもしれないよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't know, Mimi. It might be true!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって入学試験っぽいもん\n学問の島だったら、あり得るよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Like an entrance exam? For an island dedicated to learning, I could totally see that happening!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "良いところに気付いたわね。\n実は姉様も入国審査対策には頭を悩ませて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good observation. Actually, Alvina was quite troubled when she was preparing for the immigration process..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむふむ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Uh-huh."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星の案内人の特技を活かして、ヤンネさんと一緒に\n旅先案内人の漫才を猛特訓して",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She practiced intensively with Janne, using her Star Guide skills to perfect a travel guide comedy routine..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "す、すごい！\u3000育てられる特技があったんだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow! She is talented!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そして満を辞して",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And then, when everything was ready..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いい加減なこと言わないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stop filling her head with nonsense."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ね、姉様！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-Alvina?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何か熱心に話してると思ったらまったく……\nロロナさん、信じちゃダメだからね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wondered what you were discussing so earnestly... Rorona, don't believe a word of it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、嘘だったんだ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "None of it is true?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "残念ながら、こんな話に騙されるのは君くらいだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Unfortunately, you're probably the only one who would fall for such a story."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配だなぁ……ステルクさんがついていてくれて\nよかったですよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was getting worried... I'm glad Sterk is with you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう……騙されやすすぎですよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really... you're way too gullible."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなぁ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aww..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]